# =============================================================================
# PROJECT FILES - SHOULD BE TRACKED (NOT IGNORED)
# =============================================================================
# These are essential project files that should be committed:
# - README.md
# - automation-challenges.md
# - config.toml (root)
# - requirements.txt
# - main.py
# - plans/ directory (gitignored — developer working docs)
# - skills/ directory
# - examples/rpa_challenge/README.md
# - examples/rpa_challenge/config.toml
# - examples/rpa_challenge/requirements-test.txt

